---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
import { linkWhatsApp } from '../../config/site'
import Semn from '../Semn.astro'
---

<section class="bg-crem pb-20 sm:pb-28" aria-labelledby="titlu-apel">
  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="dezvaluie relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-albastru px-6 py-16 text-center text-alb sm:px-12 sm:py-24">
      <div class="absolute -left-16 -top-16 size-56 rounded-full bg-roz/70" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -right-10 size-64 rounded-full bg-portocaliu/80" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <Semn nume="accent-linie" inaltime={190} class="pointer-events-none absolute right-10 top-8 opacity-[0.14] [filter:brightness(0)_invert(1)] sm:right-20" />
      {/*
        Fata sta intr-un cerc crem, ca cercurile cu poze din antet. Varianta cu
        contur crem pe fundal inchis arata a pata, asa ca nu se foloseste: pe
        albastru, personajul are nevoie de o rondea deschisa sub el.
      */}
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-8 left-4 hidden size-[190px] overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-crem md:block xl:-bottom-10 xl:left-12 xl:size-[230px]" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/images/personaj/saluta.webp" alt="" width="257" height="640" class="absolute left-1/2 top-7 h-[210px] w-auto -translate-x-1/2 xl:top-9 xl:h-[255px]" />
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <h2 id="titlu-apel" class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Hai să vorbim 20 de minute. Gratuit, fără obligații.</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg text-alb">Îți spun sincer de unde pornim, cât durează și dacă merită. Restul decizi tu.</p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="/programare/" class="pastila pastila-alba !px-7 !py-4 text-[1.05rem]">Alege o zi din calendar</a>
          <a href={linkWhatsApp} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pastila !px-6 !py-4 text-[1.05rem] bg-navy text-alb hover:bg-cerneala">
            <Icon name="whatsapp" class="size-5" /> Scrie pe WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
